flowchart LR
    A[Answer text + session metadata]
    A --> B[normalize_text — HTML/NFKC/whitespace; preserve C++, #, .NET]
    B --> C[Feature extraction — keywords, word count]
    C --> D[baseline_v1 — relevance, keyword_coverage, completeness, overall]
    C --> E[ai_v1 — NvidiaProvider → NVIDIA: correctness / relevance / completeness / clarity / practical_understanding]
    D/E --> F[Optional ML — LinearSVC prediction attached to details['ml_evaluation']; never changes primary scores]
    F --> G[Store — CandidateAnswer + AnswerEvaluation (evaluator_version, details)]
    G --> H[UI — flash + previous-answer strip + report dimension bars]
    G --> I[Next move — AI agent FOLLOW_UP/CLARIFY or rule-based adaptive]
    style E fill:#76b900,color:#fff
    style F fill:#f59e0b,color:#111827
    style G fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
